<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech c.bank one-week repo yield hits max 75 pct.</title>
<headline>Czech c.bank one-week repo yield hits max 75 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yield at the Czech National Bank's (CNB) one-week repo tender reached the limit of 75 percent on Thursday, after the average yield of 56.63 percent in a similar tender on Wednesday, the CNB said.</p>
<p>The CNB said in a statement that all bids were accepted at the limit level.</p>
